"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"simply delete the file."
msgstr ""
"Na òptacëjô wëmôgô òd Konquerora wiednegò pëtaniô ò pòcwierdzenié przë "
"rëmaniém lopków ."

